an class="fui-Caption1Strong fui-Text _pillText_14fvn_21 _pillText_14fvn_21 ___1ynk4zk fk6fouc fy9rknc fwrc4pm fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Direct from Azure</span></div><div class="fui-Badge r1iycov ___35rgwu0 f17fgpbq frvgh55 f1996nqw ft85np5 f68mrw8 f7pw515 frpde29 fw35ms5 f11d4kpn"><span class="fui-Caption1Strong fui-Text _pillText_14fvn_21 _pillText_14fvn_21 ___1ynk4zk fk6fouc fy9rknc fwrc4pm fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Version: <!-- -->2026-07-09</span></div></div><div role="separator" aria-orientation="horizontal" class="fui-Divider _contentDivider_14fvn_25 ___14drqcq f122n59 f1ewtqcl f22iagw f1063pyq fqerorx f10pi13n fk6fouc fy9rknc figsok6 fwrc4pm f17mccla fyl8oag f16vkdww fhsnbul f1gw3sf2 f1ly5f7u f1s3tz6t f1wl9k8s f13zj6fq fkfq4zb f1vccso1 f1geml7w f1r7kh1m fjml6kk f16j7guv fx01ahm fl8d8yv fj1a37q fly5x3f f163fonl f51yk4v f13rof3u f8rth92 f6czdpx f1iyka9k fzynn9s fekrn8e f1kyqvp9 fesgyo"></div><div class="fui-Accordion _accordion_1y3y0_1"><div class="fui-AccordionItem"><h2 class="fui-AccordionHeader ___kex8dp0 f19n0e5 f1c21dwh f1s184ao ft85np5"><button aria-expanded="true" type="button" class="fui-AccordionHeader__button _sectionHeaderButton_1y3y0_10 ___1riz77g f1ewtqcl f1u2r49w f1ym3bx4 fk6fouc fkhj508 f1i3iumi f1gl81tg f1uw59to f11gcy0p f1rmphuq f37px4s fgusgyc f10pi13n fly5x3f fre7gi1 f1358rze fqdk4by f1rvrf73 f5pgtk9 f22iagw f122n59 f1k6fduh figsok6 ftqa4ok f2hkw1w f8hki3x f1d2448m f1bjia2o ffh67wi f1j6vpng f1pniga2 f987i1v f1ffjurs f15bsgw9 f14e48fq f18yb2kv fd6o370 ffwy5si f3znvyf f57olzd f4stah7 f480a47 fs1por5" style="padding-inline-start:0"><span class="fui-Text _foreground1_3adzx_6 ___i24qii0 fk6fouc fod5ikn faaz57k fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Direct from Azure models</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="fui-AccordionHeader__expandIcon _sectionHeaderIcon_1y3y0_15 ___a486so0 f1l02sjl f22iagw f122n59 f106mvju f1pp30po fqerorx f1neuvcm flqd7gy f9c4gz4 f1f5gg8d"><svg style="transform:rotate(-90deg);transition:transform 200ms ease-out" fill="currentColor" class="___9ctc0p0 f1w7gpdv fez10in f1dd5bof" aria-hidden="true" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7.65 4.15c.2-.2.5-.2.7 0l5.49 5.46c.21.22.21.57 0 .78l-5.49 5.46a.5.5 0 0 1-.7-.7L12.8 10 7.65 4.85a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.7Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></h2><div class="fui-AccordionPanel _sectionPanel_1y3y0_19 ___1rufncu f1axvtxu"><div class="_markdown_1kqq6_4"><p>Direct from Azure models are a select portfolio curated for their market-differentiated capabilities:</p>
<ul>
<li>Secure and managed by Microsoft: Purchase and manage models directly through Azure with a single license, consistent support, and no third-party dependencies, backed by Azure&#x27;s enterprise-grade infrastructure.</li>
<li>Streamlined operations: Benefit from unified billing, governance, and seamless PTU portability across models hosted on Azure - all part of Microsoft Foundry.</li>
<li>Future-ready flexibility: Access the latest models as they become available, and easily test, deploy, or switch between them within Microsoft Foundry; reducing integration effort.</li>
<li>Cost control and optimization: Scale on demand with pay-as-you-go flexibility or reserve PTUs for predictable performance and savings.</li>
</ul>
<p>Learn more about <a class="_link_1ym6v_2" href="https://aka.ms/DirectfromAzure" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><span class="_linkInline_1ym6v_7">Direct from Azure models</span> <svg aria-label="OpenInNewTab" class="_icon_6b9ww_2 ___9ctc0p0 f1w7gpdv fez10in f1dd5bof" fill="currentColor" role="img" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M6 4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v8c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h8a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2.5a.5.5 0 0 1 1 0V14a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H6a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V6a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h2.5a.5.5 0 0 1 0 1H6Zm5-.5c0-.28.22-.5.5-.5h5c.28 0 .5.22.5.5v5a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0V4.7l-4.15 4.15a.5.5 0 0 1-.7-.7L15.29 4H11.5a.5.5 0 0 1-.5-.5Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></a>.</p></div></div></div><div class="fui-AccordionItem"><h2 class="fui-AccordionHeader ___kex8dp0 f19n0e5 f1c21dwh f1s184ao ft85np5"><button aria-expanded="true" type="button" class="fui-AccordionHeader__button _sectionHeaderButton_1y3y0_10 ___1riz77g f1ewtqcl f1u2r49w f1ym3bx4 fk6fouc fkhj508 f1i3iumi f1gl81tg f1uw59to f11gcy0p f1rmphuq f37px4s fgusgyc f10pi13n fly5x3f fre7gi1 f1358rze fqdk4by f1rvrf73 f5pgtk9 f22iagw f122n59 f1k6fduh figsok6 ftqa4ok f2hkw1w f8hki3x f1d2448m f1bjia2o ffh67wi f1j6vpng f1pniga2 f987i1v f1ffjurs f15bsgw9 f14e48fq f18yb2kv fd6o370 ffwy5si f3znvyf f57olzd f4stah7 f480a47 fs1por5" style="padding-inline-start:0"><span class="fui-Text _foreground1_3adzx_6 ___i24qii0 fk6fouc fod5ikn faaz57k fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Key capabilities</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="fui-AccordionHeader__expandIcon _sectionHeaderIcon_1y3y0_15 ___a486so0 f1l02sjl f22iagw f122n59 f106mvju f1pp30po fqerorx f1neuvcm flqd7gy f9c4gz4 f1f5gg8d"><svg style="transform:rotate(-90deg);transition:transform 200ms ease-out" fill="currentColor" class="___9ctc0p0 f1w7gpdv fez10in f1dd5bof" aria-hidden="true" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 20 20" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7.65 4.15c.2-.2.5-.2.7 0l5.49 5.46c.21.22.21.57 0 .78l-5.49 5.46a.5.5 0 0 1-.7-.7L12.8 10 7.65 4.85a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.7Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></span></button></h2><div class="fui-AccordionPanel _sectionPanel_1y3y0_19 ___1rufncu f1axvtxu"><div class="_markdown_1kqq6_4"><div class="_h2Section_huplu_7"><h3 class="fui-Text _foreground1_3adzx_6 ___g0or4u0 fk6fouc fkhj508 f1i3iumi fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">About this model</h3></div>
<p>gpt‑5.6‑terra is a balanced reasoning model in the GPT‑5.6 family that delivers strong reasoning and tool-use capabilities with lower cost and high scalability. Designed for everyday enterprise workloads, Terra provides an optimal balance of performance, efficiency, and cost while supporting up to a 1M‑token context window for large-scale business applications.</p>
<div class="_h2Section_huplu_7"><h3 class="fui-Text _foreground1_3adzx_6 ___g0or4u0 fk6fouc fkhj508 f1i3iumi fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Key model capabilities</h3></div>
<ul>
<li><strong>Cost-Efficient Intelligence</strong> – Delivers competitive performance at significantly lower cost, making it ideal for scaling AI workloads across the enterprise.</li>
<li><strong>Balanced Reasoning</strong> – Strong reasoning capabilities that improve as reasoning effort increases, enabling a flexible tradeoff between speed, cost, and depth of analysis.</li>
<li><strong>Tool Use &amp; Workflow Execution</strong> – Effectively uses tools and external systems to complete real-world business workflows.</li>
<li><strong>Long-Context Understanding</strong> – Supports up to 1M tokens for processing large documents, knowledge bases, and multi-step workflows.</li>
<li><strong>Enterprise Scale</strong> – Optimized for high-volume deployments requiring reliable performance and cost efficiency.</li>
<li><strong>Robust Safety Protections</strong> – Safeguards calibrated to the model&#x27;s capabilities to help detect and mitigate risk.</li>
</ul>
<div class="_h2Section_huplu_7"><h3 class="fui-Text _foreground1_3adzx_6 ___g0or4u0 fk6fouc fkhj508 f1i3iumi fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Key use cases</h3></div>
<p>gpt‑5.6‑terra is best for scalable enterprise applications that require a balance of reasoning capability, cost efficiency, and throughput. It excels at business automation, knowledge retrieval, document analysis, workflow orchestration, agentic assistance, operational decision support, and other production workloads where organizations need strong performance at scale.</p>
<div class="_h2Section_huplu_7"><h3 class="fui-Text _foreground1_3adzx_6 ___g0or4u0 fk6fouc fkhj508 f1i3iumi fl43uef fpgzoln f1w7gpdv f6juhto f1gl81tg f2jf649">Out of scope use cases</h3></div>
